# ── media ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source video is deliberately NOT tracked. These are delivery masters
# (16-64 Mbps, up to 2 GB each); Git stores them as opaque blobs with no
# delta compression, history is immutable so they could never be removed
# later, and GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB on push.
#
# The videos live in assets/ locally and are uploaded to the host / CDN
# separately. index.html references them by relative path either way.
assets/*.mp4
assets/*.MP4
assets/*.mov
assets/*.MOV
assets/web/

# ── os / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
